You recall the canister with herbicide, taken from the shed. It's about time to find out, if it is fit for something except extermination of weed.
Trying not to make abrupt movements, you carefully take the canister, take out neck stopper and shower adhered to Irene predatory branch with chemical liquid. Covered by shining drops leafs fuzz, begin to turn dark and shrink before your eyes, but stubborn plant keeps holding her. Irene starts to cry.
"Wait, now it will take effect" you try to calm her down, being not so sure about success by yourself.
Quite a lot of time has passed, before the substance finally kills sticky fuzz, adhered to Irene's arm. Very carefully you take her by the shoulders, pull back and fall powerless together on the herb carpet, gasping for some air. Irene is embracing you tight, shaking in sobbing. So you sit on the ground, holding each other, trying not to think about gruesome fate, that you miraculously managed to escape.
When you recovered yourselves, you go back. Now it is clear, that path through the lilac plants is lethal, so you have no other option, but to make your way through the thick shrubs of white flower bushes.